{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05788","headline":"嵩山十志十首 其四 · 卢鸿一","name":"嵩山十志十首 其四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"临泱漭兮背青荧，吐云烟兮合窅冥。\n怳欻翕兮杳幽霭，意缥缈兮羣仙会。\n窅冥仙会兮枕烟庭，竦魂形兮凝视听。\n闻夫至诚必感兮祈此巅，契颢气，养丹田，终彷像兮觏灵仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢鸿一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05788.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05788","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}